  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen govemment accountability in Ukraine by investigating and exposing cases of
illicit enrichment among public officials and promoting active public oversight over itate resources,
particularly in the context of wartime govemance. In a time of increased risks of comrption and resource
mismanagement, the role of independent journalism becomes even more critical in safeguarding
transparency, trust, and the rule of law.</narrative>
  </description>
